   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating AMR using One Health Approach in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raise awareness and educate the population, professionals and policy makers on AMR.
Improve understanding of the AMR burden and antimicrobial use patterns through surveillance
Reduce the need for antimicrobials by improving infection prevention and control, farm practices and biosecurity, water sanitation and hygiene, and immunisation. 
Improve controlled access and optimise the use of antimicrobials in humans and animals
Sustainable investment into AMR and research into alternatives to antimicrobials.</narrative>
  </description>
